{
  "_readme": "Exact-match allow rules for headless Antigravity CLI (agy) workers. Install with scripts/install-rules.ps1 (dry run by default, backs up your config, asks first). Matching is exact: no wildcards, so every flag combination is its own rule and extra arguments or file paths are denied. Rules are global to every agy session and the desktop app. Groups listed in _optin are skipped unless requested with -Groups.",
